# AI Security

Assume every AI response is untrusted.

---

## Validate

Validate:

JSON

Enums

Numbers

IDs

Dates

Commands

---

## Prompt Injection

Treat user prompts as hostile.

Never expose:

Secrets

API Keys

JWT

Database URLs

Internal prompts

---

## Tool Permissions

Each tool requires permission.

AI permissions never exceed user permissions.

---

## Confirmation

Require confirmation for:

Delete

Refund

Price Changes

Inventory

Permission Changes

---

## Audit

Log:

Prompt

Response

Tool Calls

Approval

User

Duration

Model

Cost

---

## Rate Limits

Apply rate limits.

Prevent abuse.

---

## Sensitive Data

Mask:

Emails

Phone Numbers

Addresses

Payment Information

Secrets